# Dependencies & build output (recreated inside the image) — match every workspace.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/.vinext
**/.wrangler
**/.astro
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git

# AI/IDE configs
.ai
.claude
.cursor
.gemini
.kiro
.qoder
graphify-out

# Test & docs
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/e2e-results
*.md
!README.md
!infra/docker/postgres/**

# Env — keep only the committed sample; real values are injected at run time.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.sample
**/.dev.vars
**/.dev.vars.*
!**/.dev.vars.sample
infra/docker/secrets/*
!infra/docker/secrets/.gitignore

# Misc
npm-debug.log
.DS_Store
